          "start_line": 672
        },
        {
          "end_line": 1248,
          "source_id": "TICKETS",
          "start_line": 1161
        }
      ],
      "text": "Before return or handoff, record every step result, withheld closure, residual obligation and step-produced fact needed by the outer contract on the admitted durable result/evidence surface linked to the selected work carrier. Retain exact subject/basis, evidence and changed state, relevant decisions and uncertainty over effects, plus the next authorized action or return/stop condition. A conversation return alone is not durable evidence. Keep a needed residual judgment with its question, actor/authority, conclusion/scope, uncertainty and concrete revising observation; retain owner rulings in their original wording with exact scope, conditions and source, separately from interpretation. Recording grants no effect, admission or continuation, and missing ticket-edit authority routes the return to its granted owner. Private context can be discarded after the necessary facts and results are retained; no separate judgment registry, transcript or new approval is required.",
      "unknowns": [],
      "when": {
        "all": [],
        "any": []
      }
    },
    {
      "conditions": [],
      "depends_on": [
