          "start_line": 1681
        },
        {
          "end_line": 745,
          "source_id": "TICKETS",
          "start_line": 672
        }
      ],
      "text": "On resumption, reconstruct from the current work carrier, persistent workspace, governing basis, applicable recorded results and residuals without requiring the previous actor's private context. Reacquire the actual material state, including partial writes; contrary current evidence corrects a stale summary or belief and undecided disagreement stays unknown. Check every reused result's applicability and invalidators, reopening only affected support. Context loss resets no progress or obligation and proves neither undone work nor an absent effect. Before repeating or depending on an uncertain effect, reconcile its completion and whether it has ended sufficiently for that action, or yield/stop. Preserve completion_unknown; not_effected with an unestablished end is also uncertain and licenses no blind retry. Resume the next already-authorized bounded action without renewed unchanged approval, while required independence and grant boundaries remain. No universal reset or complete-history replay follows.",
      "unknowns": [],
      "when": {
        "all": [],
